      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After we figured out the initial problem, I conducted further testing and discovered that the issue does not lie with generic models, but rather with models lacking an Avatar set in the main Animator Controller. By using these models, you can bypass the performance checks (which are indicated by a Loading performance rank), but it's important to note that the menu and playable layers won't function properly. On the other hand, other users' clients won't remove components such as box colliders, which could cause significant problems, but could also be used creatively for entertainment.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
