  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To reproduce these steps is to upload in a generic avatar, the easiest way to do this is create an empty add an 'animator' then attach the 'Avatar descriptor' after this, you can drag on box colliders inside the empty, after this, and you upload, you will be able to collide with other user in vrc, that also means people can make massive colliders or cages for others and have them stuck, you can also trap people in spawn. Many cool things can come from this but also really bad things.",
